_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_

**Centralize effective skill enablement across all loading paths.**

`get_content_by_slug()` now treats WooCommerce/multisite skills as enabled when the environment matches, but other paths still use the raw DB flag: `SkillAbilities::handle_skill_load()` rejects the same disabled row with `skill_disabled`, `SkillService::format_skill()` reports it as disabled to the frontend, and `get_index_for_prompt()` still uses `get_all( true )`. That makes an auto-enabled skill injectable in one path but unavailable/disabled elsewhere.

Consider exposing a public effective-enabled helper and using it anywhere skill availability is checked or serialized.

<details>
<summary>♻️ Suggested direction</summary>

