**Define the refresh animation in the floating stylesheet.**

This file references `spin`, but no `@keyframes spin` is defined here, so the floating-widget refresh icon will not animate when this stylesheet is loaded without the admin-page stylesheet.


<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
 .gratis-ai-agent-provider-selector__refresh:disabled svg {
-	animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
+	animation: gratis-ai-agent-provider-refresh-spin 1s linear infinite;
 }
+
+@keyframes gratis-ai-agent-provider-refresh-spin {
+	from {
+		transform: rotate( 0deg );
+	}
+	to {
+		transform: rotate( 360deg );
+	}
+}
```
</details>

