references animation name "spin" in the selector
.gratis-ai-agent-provider-selector__refresh:disabled svg but does not define it;
add an `@keyframes` spin block to this CSS (in the same floating-widget
stylesheet) that animates transform: rotate(0deg) to transform: rotate(360deg)
(e.g., from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); }) so
the refresh icon actually spins when the selector applies; ensure the keyframe
name exactly matches "spin".
```

</details>

