122, The test test_handle_generate_invalid_quality_falls_back is using a vacuous
assertion by comparing the error code to the input string 'ultra'; change the
assertion to check against the expected legacy error code (e.g.,
'invalid_quality') so it actually verifies legacy validation behavior; do the
same fix in test_handle_generate_invalid_style_falls_back (compare against
'invalid_style' instead of 'cartoon'), and update
test_handle_generate_invalid_size_falls_back to explicitly compare against
'invalid_size' rather than relying on the input matching the legacy code; locate
these assertions in the AiImageAbilitiesTest methods and replace the asserted
values accordingly to restore the test intent.
