+ *
+ * ## EXAMPLES
+ *
+ *   # List all providers
+ *   wp sd-ai-agent models
+ *
+ *   # List models for a specific provider
+ *   wp sd-ai-agent models --provider=ultimate-ai-connector-anthropic-max
+ *
+ *   # Machine-readable JSON
